            "sid": "EZR 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man ka dwi mir abirone wok, man nyithindho mir Israel gini i adhura, dhanu cokri karacelo calu ng’atu acel i Yerusalem. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.27.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ai 27:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yecuwa ma wod Yozadak ulund ucungo malu, ku utumin mire ma julam, man Zerubabel ma wod Cealtiel, man utumin mire, e gigomo pemblam pa Mungu mir Israel, kara gimi lam m’awang’a i wie, calu egore i cik pa Musa ma dhanu pa Mungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.28.1+NUM.28.2+NUM.28.3+NUM.28.4+NUM.28.5+NUM.28.6+NUM.28.7+NUM.28.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Wel 28:1-8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man giketho pemblamne wi there; kum lworo negogi ni dhanu mi ng’ombuno: man gimio lam m’awang’a i wie ni Yehova en e lam m’awang’a mi kugweno kud uthieno. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.29.12+NUM.29.13+NUM.29.14+NUM.29.15+NUM.29.16+NUM.29.17+NUM.29.18+NUM.29.19+NUM.29.20+NUM.29.21+NUM.29.22+NUM.29.23+NUM.29.24+NUM.29.25+NUM.29.26+NUM.29.27+NUM.29.28+NUM.29.29+NUM.29.30+NUM.29.31+NUM.29.32+NUM.29.33+NUM.29.34+NUM.29.35+NUM.29.36+NUM.29.37+NUM.29.38"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Wel 29:12-38",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E gikwiro agba mi odbak, calu egore, man gimio lam m’awang’a ma ceng’ ku ceng’ ku welne, calku lembapoka, calu m’umaku piny ceng’ ku ceng’; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Wel 28:11-29:39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "man yo ku ng’eye gimio lam m’awang’a ma thiri thiri, ku lam mi dwi ma por, man mir agba ceke m’aketha pa Yehova ma judwokogi leng’, man mi dhanu ceke kubang’gi kubang’gi m’umio lam mi berocwiny ni Yehova ku laccing’. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ugambre i ceng’ ma kwong’ane mi dwi mir abirone githeko mio lam m’awang’a ni Yehova: ento the hekalu pa Yehova fodi juguro ngo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gimio sente bende ni jutong’kidi, man ni jubodho mi bau; man cemo, ku giramadha, ku mo, ni dhanu mi Sidon, man ni dhanu mi Turo, kara gikel musonge kud i Lebanon giter i nam, ba Yopa, calku lembang’ola ma gigamu ba Kuro m’ubimo mir Ajemi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.3.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
