        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nie i rundi mir arionde mi bino migi ba ot pa Mungu i Yerusalem, i dwi mir arionde, gilund githeko en e Zerubabel ma wod Cealtiel, man Yecuwa ma wod Yozadak, ku dong uturneggi ma julam ku Julawi, man dhanu ceke m’uai i ng’eca ucidho Yerusalem, man giketho Julawi, ma rundi migi tundo pier ario ku m’ukadhu de, kara gibed ni julieu mi tic mi ot pa Yehova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yecuwa lund ucungo ku wote man utumin mire, Kadmiel ku wote, ma wot Yuda, karacelo, kara gibed julieu jutic i ot pa Mungu: wot Henadad, ku wotgi man uturneggi ma Julawi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CH.25.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Kei 25:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man ka jugom giguro the hekalu pa Yehova, giketho julam ukendo kendi migi man gibedo kud agwara, man Julawi ma wot Asaf kud umbukulumbu, kara gipak Yehova, calu Daudi m’ubimo mir Israel uketho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
