                  "text": "Yer 33:11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E giwero wer ng’atuman ni wadi man ni wadi i pakupak man i foyofoc ni Yehova, giwacu kumae, Kum en e ber, kum mer mi bero pare bedo nja yo bang’ Israel. Man dhanune ceke gikok ku kok ma dit, ka gipaku Yehova, kum juguro the ot pa Yehova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento dhanu dupa ma kind julam ku Julawi ku wi udi pa wego, dhanu m’uti m’uneno ot ma kwong’a, ka juguro the ot maeni i wang’gi, giywak ku dwandgi ma dit; man dupa gikok ku dwandgi ma tek ni anyong’a: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ketho nia dhanu copo ng’io ba dwal mi kok mir anyong’a ngo ku ba dwal mi ywak mi dhanu; kum dhanu kok ku dwandgi ma dit, man badwal uwinjre ku bor.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.3.13"
            ]
